# The Starcage enters on turn 5 and exiles both Ornithopters (mana value 0). On turn 7 Bot1 casts Mox Emerald and
# Haywire Mite, then sacrifices the Mite to exile the Starcage: both Ornithopters return to the battlefield at once
# under their owners' control (CR 610.3), no stack involved. The Mite came after the Starcage's trigger, so it was never
# exiled by it; a Plains stays throughout (a land is no artifact or creature).

